                                  sdio_claim_host()
txrx_work
  sdio_claim_host() // sleeps
                                  cancel_work_sync() // sleeps

In addition, when txrx_work() runs concurrently with close()/reset()
it better not to re-enable interrupts by testing for BTMTKSDIO_FUNC_ENABLED
