+	depends on NFC_PN533=y && KUNIT=y
+	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
+	help
+	  Enable the KUnit regression tests for the NFC PN533 driver,
+	  covering bounds checking of device-supplied frame lengths.
+	  If unsure, say N.
